#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.rst:2
msgid "HR"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres des reconstructions haute résolution."
msgstr "Class containing high-resolution visualization settings:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:5
msgid "``Dimension`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup`) : mode de reconstruction 2D, pile Z ou rotation 3D."
msgstr "``Dimension`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup`) : reconstruction mode: 2D, Z stack, or 3D rotation."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:6
msgid "``Type`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup`) : famille de données, localisations ou trajectoires."
msgstr "``Type`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup`) : data family, localizations or tracks."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:7
msgid "``Source`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : grandeur utilisée pour colorer ou pondérer les points."
msgstr "``Source`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : quantity used to color or weight the points."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:8
msgid "``Scaling`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : facteur multiplicatif appliqué à l'intensité ; valeur par défaut : ``1``."
msgstr "``Scaling`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : multiplicative factor applied to the intensity; default value: ``1``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:9
msgid "``Color mode`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : additionne les contributions superposées ou conserve leur maximum."
msgstr "``Color mode`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : sums overlapping contributions or retains their maximum."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:10
msgid "``Ratio`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : facteur d'agrandissement ; valeur par défaut : ``4``."
msgstr "``Ratio`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : upscaling factor; default value: ``4``."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:11
msgid "``Crop`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : retire automatiquement les bordures vides."
msgstr "``Crop`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : automatically removes empty borders."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:12
msgid "``Remove Beads`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : exclut les billes de la reconstruction."
msgstr "``Remove Beads`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : excludes beads from the reconstruction."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:13
msgid "``Drift Correction`` et ``Smooth Drift`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : appliquent puis lissent la correction de dérive."
msgstr "``Drift Correction`` and ``Smooth Drift`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : apply and then smooth the drift correction."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:14
msgid "``Gaussian`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian`) : paramètres du rendu gaussien."
msgstr "``Gaussian`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian`) : Gaussian-rendering settings."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR:15
msgid "``3D`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR3D.HR3D`) : paramètres de la pile ou de la rotation 3D."
msgstr "``3D`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR3D.HR3D`) : Z-stack or 3D-rotation settings."

