msgstr "Label of the group displayed in the interface."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR.setting_list:1
msgid "Définition des paramètres du groupe et de leur configuration."
msgstr "Definition of the group's settings and their configuration."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR.gaussian:1
