msgstr "Group of settings related to the Gaussian representation (:class:`HRGaussian <palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian>`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR.HR.hr_3d:1
msgid "Groupe de paramètres liés à la reconstruction 3D (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR3D.HR3D`)."
msgstr "Group of settings related to the 3D reconstruction (:class:`HR3D <palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HR3D.HR3D>`)."

